  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Non-Food Items Stockpile Management and Capacity Building for Emergency Preparedness &#x2013; Hurricane Season Haiti 2021 - 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM aims to further strengthen the capacities of the Civil Protection General Directorate at national and departmental levels to assist disaster affected populations during the hurricane seasons from 2021 to 2023 in Haiti. The first outcome is maintenance of warehouse stock of emergency relief commodities. The second outcome is strengthening the capacities of national disaster preparedness authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
